# Avion design system

Premium · Modern · Trustworthy · Smooth · Global · Aviation-focused.

## Asset lock (P0)
ONLY use files that currently exist under `Frontend/public/images/`, `Frontend/public/videos/`, and `Frontend/public/partners/`. Never use Unsplash, remote stock, or AI-generated images unless the user supplies new files. Prefer camelCase filenames.

### Banned deleted assets (never restore, never reference)
- `avionHeroBackground.png` / `avionHeroBackground.webp`
- `flightBookingService.webp`
- `baggageService.webp`
- `flyWithUsBanner.png`
- `flyWithUsLandmarks.jpg` (v1 only; `flyWithUsLandmarksV2.jpg` is allowed)
- `earthGlobe.jpg`
- `cancellationService.webp`, `flightChangeService.webp`, `rewardTravelService.webp`, `seatSelectionService.webp`, `tripPlanningService.webp`, `vacationPackageService.webp`
- `thoughtfulService/flightDeals.png` (deleted; do not restore)

Allowed imagery (only if the file exists on disk):
- Brand/hero: `siteLogo` and `homeLogo` (same main mark: navy pin + orange arc + white plane, transparent PNG with white outline only; used site-wide), `heroAircraftPoster`, favicons (`favicon.ico`, `favicon32`/`48`/`192`, `appleTouchIcon`), hero/smart-traveler videos, `heroAircraftMobile.mp4` (mobile hero only)
- Destinations: `Frontend/public/images/destinations/*`
- Thoughtful service / fly-with-us: files under `thoughtfulService/`, `flyWithUsLandmarksV2.jpg`
- Partners: `partners/*.svg`
- User-supplied replacements only when explicitly provided in chat

## Layout
Container `1240px` + `24px` gutters. Section padding `80px`. Spacing scale 8–120.

## Colors
Page themes (scoped; do not mix):
- `/en` homepage: dark canvas + yellow accent (`globals.css` `:root`)
- `/en/europe`: white + aviation blue (`.destination-landing`)
- `/en/live`: white + signal red (`.live-landing`)
- `/en/book`: paper ivory + go green (`.ads-landing`)

Legacy token names (`aviation-blue`, etc.) map to each page’s accent via scoped CSS variables.

## Type
Plus Jakarta Sans. Hero clamp 42–72 / 700. Section 36/700. Card 18/600. Body 15 / muted.

## Sections (order) — main homepage `/en`
Header pill → Hero + overlapping search → Destinations (Popular destinations slider, 4 cards at a time on desktop, 8 images total — Montreal, New York, Las Vegas, Miami, Cancun, London, Paris, Tokyo; no Domestic/International tabs) → Partner trust strip → Smart Traveler → Thoughtful service → FAQ → Support CTA → Testimonials → Fly with us → Footer → mobile sticky Call

Shared across landings: partner trust, FAQ (where conversion/objection handling matters), mobile sticky Call. Other pages keep their own section models.
## Radius / shadow / motion
8 / 12 / 16 / 24 / 999. Soft shadows only. Hover lift 2px buttons, destination cards -6px + image scale 1.05. Respect reduced motion.
